description	"Imperial Assassin

^2Weaponry:
- Poison Pistol (1)
- Disruptor Rifle (2)
- Rosh-11 Blaster Rifle (2)
- Enhanced Melee (1)
- Feign Death

^6Inventory:
- Medpac (25HP+)

^8Attributes:
- Undetectable [Invisible To Sense]
- Heal (1)

^3Abilities:
- Holographic Projector [Spy Disguise]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- 4 Tracking Darts ^3[CS2 Melee]

Assassins were trained to kill targets of importance, either for guns-for-hire or owned by wealthy politicians. Members of the profession were referred to by many euphemisms and epithets. 'Problem solvers' in the Corporate Sector Authority, 'exterminators' in the Outer Rim Territories, and 'slayers' in the Core Worlds. Whatever their name, most professional assassins were concerned solely with credits."